STRING 1383
{
Well done. The Undercity teems with new Forsaken.
}

STRING 1385
{
Grand Apothecary Putress was asking for you. I believe word of your skills is spreading fast.
}

STRING 1387
{
Ah, the reagents I requested. I trust they were not too troublesome to procure.
}

STRING 1389
{
By the way, the mason you rescued earlier requires your assistance. You’ll find him near the canal.
}

STRING 1391
{
Shipments from the quarry are already coming in! I can’t thank you two enough. Please, accept this as a token of gratitude.
}

STRING 1393
{
I hate to ask something of you again so soon, but one of my excavation crews hasn’t returned. Would you mind tracking them down?
}

STRING 1395
{
The Scourge had best think twice before trying that again. Take your reward.
}

STRING 1397
{
Hmm. These parts will suffice. At least you didn’t damage them. Much.
}

STRING 1399
{
Each ghoul showed signs of intelligence? Interesting. Keever can make use of this.
}

STRING 1401
{
Excellent work. The canals flow with plague, and the living will risk much in an attempted invasion.
}

STRING 1403
{
Did you find my eye? Oh, thank the Dark Lady! I’d never find my way out of here without it!
}

